# Hyprland Blue — the same palette as foot, mako and waybar
# (bg #1b1e22, fg #f0f4fa, dim #8f9aa8, accent #6ea8de, selection #3b5a7a).
# Shows up in Dolphin under Settings > Window Color Scheme.
# Keep in sync with the copy of these groups in kdedefaults/kdeglobals.

